{"id":"diplo_me","lemma":"diplôme","pos":"noun","rank":2210,"glosses":["diploma (document issued by an educational institution testifying that the recipient has earned a degree or has successfully completed a particular course of study)"],"ipa":"/di.plom/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/62/Fr-dipl%C3%B4me.ogg/Fr-dipl%C3%B4me.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"diplômes"},"examples":[{"text":"Je dispose d'un diplôme.","en":"I have a diploma.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to organize","l":"disposer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tom a eu son diplôme.","en":"Tom graduated.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1093661","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"J'obtiendrai mon diplôme cette année, j'espère.","en":"I'll graduate this year, I hope.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to get, to obtain","l":"obtenir"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"espérer"}]},{"text":"Que vas-tu mettre pour la cérémonie de remise des diplômes ?","en":"What are you wearing to graduation?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to put"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"ceremony"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"delivery, handing over"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Elle a obtenu son diplôme avec les honneurs.","en":"She graduated with honors.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to get, to obtain","l":"obtenir"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"honor","l":"honneur"}]}]}